---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Mailbox Plus" description="Mailbox Plus privacy policy — how we collect, use, and protect your personal information." canonical="/privacy">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-[var(--color-text-primary)] space-y-6">
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> January 2025</p>
      <p>Mailbox Plus respects your privacy. This policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you visit our website or use our services.</p>
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We collect information you provide directly: name, email, phone number, and shipping details when you use our contact form, request a quote, or sign up for our rewards program.</p>
      <p>We automatically collect certain information when you visit our site, including IP address, browser type, and pages visited, to help us improve our website and services.</p>
      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To provide and improve our shipping, printing, and business services</li>
        <li>To respond to your inquiries and customer service requests</li>
        <li>To send occasional service-related communications (with your consent)</li>
        <li>To comply with legal obligations</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Information Sharing</h2>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share information with trusted third parties (e.g., shipping carriers) only as necessary to fulfill your requests or as required by law.</p>
      <h2>Data Security</h2>
      <p>We implement reasonable security measures to protect your information. However, no method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For questions about this policy, contact us at help@mailboxplusohio.com or visit our store in Concord Township, Ohio.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
